"releaseNotes":"Your Monster Mash adventure isn't over yet!\n\nKeep collecting spooky stickers and finish your album before it's too late!\nDive into Ghostbusters and KPop Demon Hunters themed events\nUnlock frightfully fun rewards and creepy collectibles\nUpdate now and collect those final stickers before they disappear!", "artistId":305003647, "artistName":"Scopely, Inc.", "genres":["Games", "Family", "Board", "Entertainment"], "price":0.00, "bundleId":"com.scopely.monopolygo", "minimumOsVersion":"15.0", "releaseDate":"2023-04-11T07:00:00Z", "trackId":1621328561, "trackName":"MONOPOLY GO!", "genreIds":["6014", "7009", "7004", "6016"], "primaryGenreName":"Games", "primaryGenreId":6014, "sellerName":"Scopely, Inc.", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-11-12T19:30:58Z", "version":"1.81.1", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Hit GO and roll the dice in MONOPOLY GO! - the free-to-play game reimagining the world’s most iconic multiplayer board game. Enjoy a blend of classic tabletop nostalgia and fast-paced social play as you build your empire, connect with friends, and compete in an exciting online board game.\n\n• JOIN ANYTIME, ANYWHERE: Play for minutes or hours - MONOPOLY GO! fits your life perfectly. Jump into casual board games on your phone whenever you want to play. \n• PLAY TOGETHER OR SOLO: Team up for co-op multiplayer games, target friends and shut down their landmarks, or enjoy solo games like Treasures and Juggle Jam.\n• JOIN EVENTS: Take part in time-limited events and mini-games like Partners, Blocks Boutique or Racers. Roll the dice, collect rewards, and climb the ranks.\n• CLIMB THE LEADERBOARD: Compete in global tournaments, rank up to unlock exclusive rewards and prove you’re the ultimate tycoon!\n• COLLECT & TRADE: Complete seasonal albums and trade with the online MONOPOLY GO! community to unlock new stickers, emojis, shields, and tokens.\n• CONNECT WITH FAMILY & FRIENDS: Invite your family or make new friends as you play co-op games, trade stickers, and even steal from their bank!\n• ROLL & BUILD: Relive the MONOPOLY board game nostalgia! Roll the dice to pass GO, collect rent, and draw cards as you build your MONOPOLY GO! empire. Expand your board with new landmarks and bring the game’s board to life. \n\nA CLASSIC TWIST ON BOARD GAME FUN \nExperience MONOPOLY reimagined for fast, casual mobile play. Build your empire on the go - roll the dice, collect rent, and upgrade landmarks at your own pace. Whether you have thirty seconds or thirty minutes, every dice roll brings the board to life. MONOPOLY GO! is the ultimate free multiplayer game for classic but fast-paced board game fun.\n\nCONNECT, PLAY, AND COMPETE\nIn MONOPOLY GO!, you never play alone. Every dice roll creates new chances! Land on the right spaces to sneak into your friends’ vaults for a Bank Heist or shut down their landmarks. Join a global online community to trade stickers and complete seasonal albums together for big rewards. Stay connected, make new friends, and enjoy multiplayer games that feel like a family board game night.\n\nNEW EVENTS EVERY DAY\nPlay fun mini-games like Peg-E Prize Drop, Juggle Jam, or Fortune Flip to win rewards. Team up with friends in co-op partner events to build exciting attractions or play solo adventures like Treasure Dig to unlock hidden rewards. With new boards and custom dice tokens dropping every season, the adventure never stops!\n\nEASY TO PICK UP, HARD TO PUT DOWN\nPlay for a few minutes or longer, MONOPOLY GO! fits your life. Whether you’re a lifelong board game fan or a new tycoon, roll the dice and win anytime, anywhere. Download MONOPOLY GO! now and start building your empire in one of the most popular online board games.\n\nMONOPOLY GO! is free to play, though some in-game items can also be purchased for real money. An internet connection is required to play the game.\n\nThe MONOPOLY name and logo, the distinctive design of the game board, the four corner squares, the MR. MONOPOLY name and character, as well as each of the distinctive elements of board and playing pieces are trademarks of Hasbro, Inc. for its property trading game and game equipment. © 1935, 2026 Hasbro.", "trackCensoredName":"MONOPOLY GO!", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/monopoly-go/id1621328561?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"9+", "averageUserRating":4.79755999999999982463805281440727412700653076171875, "userRatingCount":3894319}]
